            "type": "game",
            "name": "Tales of the Tiny Planet",
            "steam_appid": 616040,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/dfc08b07cd953ed8f7f9b14287455628.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >«Tales of the Tiny Planet» tells the story of a Planet searching through the galaxies for his lost friends. You have the ability to manipulate the world elements to guide him safely through the galaxies in this Physics-Puzzle-Adventure. Will the missing planet be behind the next portal? Find out, Beat the high-score or compete with your friends in this new Physics-Puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/f61be10f53e53c1cf297320af335d6c4.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One button controls everything - Think that it's simple?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use one button to control a group of complex mechanisms. The timing of the button press must be precise to carry the planet through the portal to the next level.Try to beat the levels as fast as possible to collect stars that will unlock more levels. Each world brings new elements, mechanics and surprises. Find out how you can bring all the planet-friends back together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/3e0897f35aa9031fac773a24e352dfc1.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=140 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 lovingly crafted worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 72 varied levels + 12 secret ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stars and stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lots of achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rankings - to compete and overtake your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Planets (Have we already mentioned that?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trading cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite vastness and endless joy</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/dfc08b07cd953ed8f7f9b14287455628.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=140 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >«Tales of the Tiny Planet» tells the story of a Planet searching through the galaxies for his lost friends. You have the ability to manipulate the world elements to guide him safely through the galaxies in this Physics-Puzzle-Adventure. Will the missing planet be behind the next portal? Find out, Beat the high-score or compete with your friends in this new Physics-Puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/f61be10f53e53c1cf297320af335d6c4.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One button controls everything - Think that it's simple?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use one button to control a group of complex mechanisms. The timing of the button press must be precise to carry the planet through the portal to the next level.Try to beat the levels as fast as possible to collect stars that will unlock more levels. Each world brings new elements, mechanics and surprises. Find out how you can bring all the planet-friends back together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616040/extras/3e0897f35aa9031fac773a24e352dfc1.avif?t=1729252580\" width=638 height=140 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 lovingly crafted worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 72 varied levels + 12 secret ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stars and stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lots of achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rankings - to compete and overtake your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Planets (Have we already mentioned that?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trading cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite vastness and endless joy</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Tales of the Tiny Planet tells the story of a separated group of planet friends who want to reunite. You have to assist them against the dangers of time and space.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Chinês tradicional, Japonês, Coreano, Russo",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 7,
                    "review_score_desc": "Positive",
                    "total_positive": 21,
                    "total_negative": 5,
                    "total_reviews": 26
                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "165309816",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198315893457",
                            "num_reviews": 57,
                            "playtime_forever": 322,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 322,
                            "last_played": 1715635774
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A game quick to finish, not only because of the total playing time, which can be about 2 hours depending on the attempts, number of players and if we want to complete the game (marathon mode, all stages with 3 stars, etc.), but also because of how fast and enjoyable it’s to repeat or beat the stage without wasting time with loading screens. It’s a very fun game, both for the physics-based gameplay and coordination when solving the puzzles, and for the adorable sounds, voices and phrases of the Tiny Planets. Most worlds are relatively simple, except for the final world, which can get complicated, especially if playing alone. It’s playable and enjoyable for one person, but more so for two. Playing as two doesn’t add new elements to the screens, but control of the mechanisms is divided between both.\n\n\n\n\n[ESP]\n\nUn juego rápido de acabar, no solo por el tiempo total de juego, que pueden ser unas 2 horas según los intentos, número de jugadores y si queremos completar el juego (modo maratón, todas las pantallas con 3 estrellas, etc.), sino también por lo rápido y ameno en repetir o pasar de fase sin perder tiempo con pantallas de carga o títulos innecesarios. Es un juego simple y muy divertido, tanto por la jugabilidad basada en las físicas y la coordinación a la hora de resolver los puzzles, como por los sonidos, las vocecillas y las frases adorables de los Tiny Planets. La mayoría de mundos son relativamente sencillos, a excepción del mundo final, que se puede complicar, sobre todo si se juega solo. Es jugable y disfrutable a uno, pero más a dos, pese a que la experiencia no es tan marcada como en otros juegos de pantalla compartida. Jugar a dos no añade elementos nuevos a las pantallas, sino que el control de los mecanismos se divide entre ambos.",
